 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Time Complexity**: $O(N \cdot S \cdot D)$ per step, where $N$ is the number of rays sampled, $S$ is the number of samples per ray, and $D$ is the MLP depth/width [S1, unofficial][S3].
-- **Memory Complexity**: $O(N \cdot S)$ for storing intermediate ray samples and gradients [S3].
-- **Performance**: Training requires multiple epochs and iterations; GPU memory usage is approximately $15.5$ GB with default settings [S3].
