 ## Background
-The NeRF training loop was introduced in "Neural Radiance Fields" by Mildenhall et al. (2020) [S1, unofficial][S3]. It builds on earlier work on coordinate-based neural representations and differentiable volume rendering [S2, unofficial]. The method has become a standard baseline for view synthesis and 3D reconstruction [S3].
